{"level":50,"time":1793899023036,"pid":18026,"hostname":"Johns-MacBook-Air.local","name":"CodeCanvas","err":{"type":"OutputParserException","message":"Failed to parse. Text: \"{\n  \"sections\": [\n    {\n      \"key\": \"section_0\",\n      \"content\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \"HumbleBeeAI optimized LumioHub AI’s video recognition workflow with ROI processing and a 30-second track-timing protocol.\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"d2a0ebc6-84c6-4e33-97e6-4dfb597ffe17\"\n              }\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"key\": \"section_1\",\n      \"content\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \"LumioHub AI supports enterprise workplace management through computer vision and real-time analytics for attendance, on-premise security and administrative workflows. As deployments grew, processing full video frames and retaining track frames for prolonged periods created computational and memory bottlenecks. HumbleBeeAI implemented ROI processing and a track-timing mechanism to address these issues. The case study describes the implementation and its reported operational effects; it provides no quantified cost or latency figures.\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"d04eac3b-313d-464d-8844-c921d2651fe3\"\n              }\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"c8819c88-b345-4eff-8ea7-4e44006f8623\"\n              }\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"5f4fdfed-c2e3-4106-b9c5-4fb451db84e7\"\n              }\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"key\": \"section_2\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n              \"content\": [\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"text\",\n                  \"text\": \"The platform’s computer-vision models analyzed entire frames even when faces appeared in only limited areas. The case study says this unnecessary analysis increased computational expenditure, slowed processing and strained resources as deployment expanded.\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                  \"attrs\": {\n                    \"sourceChunkId\": \"c8819c88-b345-4eff-8ea7-4e44006f8623\"\n                  }\n                }\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n              \"content\": [\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"text\",\n                  \"text\": \"A separate memory bottleneck came from saving every frame for an active track until the person left camera view. People could remain visible for over an hour, allowing stored frames to accumulate and risking system instability while limiting capacity in high-traffic environments.\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                  \"attrs\": {\n                    \"sourceChunkId\": \"c8819c88-b345-4eff-8ea7-4e44006f8623\"\n                  }\n                }\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n              \"content\": [\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"text\",\n                  \"text\": \"The case study identifies enterprise deployment growth and high volumes of video data as operating conditions. It does not provide workload benchmarks, hardware details or baseline measurements.\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                  \"attrs\": {\n                    \"sourceChunkId\": \"d04eac3b-313d-464d-8844-c921d2651fe3\"\n                  }\n                },\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                  \"attrs\": {\n                    \"sourceChunkId\": \"c8819c88-b345-4eff-8ea7-4e44006f8623\"\n                  }\n                }\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"key\": \"section_3\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n              \"content\": [\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"text\",\n                  \"text\": \"HumbleBeeAI implemented a two-part optimization focused on reducing the data analyzed and bounding how long track data remained active.\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                  \"attrs\": {\n                    \"sourceChunkId\": \"680522ad-8ece-414e-a6c3-aa59d9ad09ab\"\n                  }\n                }\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"heading\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"level\": 3\n              },\n              \"content\": [\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"text\",\n                  \"text\": \"Region of Interest processing\"\n                }\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n              \"content\": [\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"text\",\n                  \"text\": \"Rather than analyze an entire video frame, the system isolates the relevant sections where faces are detected and processes those pixels. The purpose is to avoid spending computation on unrelated portions of each frame.\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                  \"attrs\": {\n                    \"sourceChunkId\": \"680522ad-8ece-414e-a6c3-aa59d9ad09ab\"\n                  }\n                }\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"heading\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"level\": 3\n              },\n              \"content\": [\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"text\",\n                  \"text\": \"Track-duration management\"\n                }\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n              \"content\": [\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"text\",\n                  \"text\": \"HumbleBeeAI configured a 30-second timer for each active track. When a track remains active beyond that period, the system designates it as removed and assigns a new track ID if the person is still in view. This caps the frames stored for any single track, addressing the accumulation that caused memory pressure.\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                  \"attrs\": {\n                    \"sourceChunkId\": \"680522ad-8ece-414e-a6c3-aa59d9ad09ab\"\n                  }\n                }\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"heading\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"level\": 3\n              },\n              \"content\": [\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"text\",\n                  \"text\": \"Capabilities delivered\"\n                }\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"bulletList\",\n              \"content\": [\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"listItem\",\n                  \"content\": [\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n                      \"content\": [\n                        {\n                          \"type\": \"text\",\n                          \"text\": \"Face-region-focused frame processing to reduce the volume of video data analyzed.\"\n                        },\n                        {\n                          \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                          \"attrs\": {\n                            \"sourceChunkId\": \"680522ad-8ece-414e-a6c3-aa59d9ad09ab\"\n                          }\n                        }\n                      ]\n                    }\n                  ]\n                },\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"listItem\",\n                  \"content\": [\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n                      \"content\": [\n                        {\n                          \"type\": \"text\",\n                          \"text\": \"A 30-second active-track timing rule, including track removal and a new track ID when the person remains visible.\"\n                        },\n                        {\n                          \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                          \"attrs\": {\n                            \"sourceChunkId\": \"680522ad-8ece-414e-a6c3-aa59d9ad09ab\"\n                          }\n                        }\n                      ]\n                    }\n                  ]\n                }\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n              \"content\": [\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"text\",\n                  \"text\": \"The supplied image illustrates a workplace attendance scenario associated with the platform; it is not a technical diagram of the optimization.\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                  \"attrs\": {\n                    \"sourceChunkId\": \"b408a0f4-ea59-45e5-a90d-6532042c355d\"\n                  }\n                }\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"image\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"b408a0f4-ea59-45e5-a90d-6532042c355d\",\n                \"alt\": \"Illustration of a smart office attendance display showing employee entry and exit times.\"\n              }\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"key\": \"section_4\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n              \"content\": [\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"text\",\n                  \"text\": \"The case study reports operational improvements following implementation, but does not provide numeric before-and-after measurements. Reported outcomes include:\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                  \"attrs\": {\n                    \"sourceChunkId\": \"509118b1-24e0-40ea-8264-ad07784eee95\"\n                  }\n                }\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"bulletList\",\n              \"content\": [\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"listItem\",\n                  \"content\": [\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n                      \"content\": [\n                        {\n                          \"type\": \"text\",\n                          \"text\": \"Lower computational costs: ROI processing reduces the data requiring analysis. The report says the platform can handle a higher volume of video streams simultaneously without overburdening computational resources; it gives no cost figures or stream counts.\"\n                        },\n                        {\n                          \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                          \"attrs\": {\n                            \"sourceChunkId\": \"509118b1-24e0-40ea-8264-ad07784eee95\"\n                          }\n                        }\n                      ]\n                    }\n                  ]\n                },\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"listItem\",\n                  \"content\": [\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n                      \"content\": [\n                        {\n                          \"type\": \"text\",\n                          \"text\": \"More controlled memory use: the report says the track-timing protocol mitigated the risk of RAM overload and maintained stable memory consumption when people remained visible for extended periods. No RAM measurements are supplied.\"\n                        },\n                        {\n                          \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                          \"attrs\": {\n                            \"sourceChunkId\": \"509118b1-24e0-40ea-8264-ad07784eee95\"\n                          }\n                        }\n                      ]\n                    }\n                  ]\n                },\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"listItem\",\n                  \"content\": [\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n                      \"content\": [\n                        {\n                          \"type\": \"text\",\n                          \"text\": \"More responsive processing: the solution allows track data to be processed without waiting for a subject to disappear, and the report describes lower latency. No latency measurement or comparison is provided.\"\n                        },\n                        {\n                          \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                          \"attrs\": {\n                            \"sourceChunkId\": \"509118b1-24e0-40ea-8264-ad07784eee95\"\n                          }\n                        }\n                      ]\n                    }\n                  ]\n                }\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"key\": \"section_5\",\n              \"content\": [\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n                  \"content\": [\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"text\",\n                      \"text\": \"The source documents the implemented ROI framework and 30-second track-timing protocol. It does not specify model or infrastructure details, independent validation, or quantified performance results. Further optimization and integration of new AI capabilities are described as ongoing exploration with the client, not as completed features.\"\n                    },\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                      \"attrs\": {\n                        \"sourceChunkId\": \"680522ad-8ece-414e-a6c3-aa59d9ad09ab\"\n                      }\n                    },\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                      \"attrs\": {\n                        \"sourceChunkId\": \"2e784e4a-07df-43fc-a2e5-a8e20de1600a\"\n                      }\n                    }\n                  ]\n                },\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n                  \"content\": [\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"text\",\n                      \"text\": \"The PDF references an “Open original HumbleBeeAI page,” but the source material provided here does not include the page URL. No link can be reproduced without that URL.\"\n                    },\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                      \"attrs\": {\n                        \"sourceChunkId\": \"d2a0ebc6-84c6-4e33-97e6-4dfb597ffe17\"\n                      }\n                    }\n                  ]\n                }\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"key\": \"section_6\",\n              \"content\": [\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n                  \"content\": [\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"text\",\n                      \"text\": \"This engagement addressed two specific LumioHub AI constraints: unnecessary computation across full video frames and memory growth from prolonged tracking. The delivered ROI and track-timing changes were reported to lower computational burden, control memory use and improve responsiveness, while the available case study leaves the size of those impacts unquantified.\"\n                    },\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                      \"attrs\": {\n                        \"sourceChunkId\": \"c8819c88-b345-4eff-8ea7-4e44006f8623\"\n                      }\n                    },\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                      \"attrs\": {\n                        \"sourceChunkId\": \"680522ad-8ece-414e-a6c3-aa59d9ad09ab\"\n                      }\n                    },\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                      \"attrs\": {\n                        \"sourceChunkId\": \"509118b1-24e0-40ea-8264-ad07784eee95\"\n                      }\n                    }\n                  ]\n                }\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        \"analysis\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\". Error: [{\"code\":\"invalid_value\",\"values\":[\"paragraph\",\"heading\",\"text\",\"bulletList\",\"orderedList\",\"listItem\",\"blockquote\",\"codeBlock\",\"horizontalRule\",\"hardBreak\",\"image\",\"sourceCitation\"],\"path\":[\"sections\",1,\"content\",1,\"type\"],\"message\":\"Invalid option: expected one of \\\"paragraph\\\"|\\\"heading\\\"|\\\"text\\\"|\\\"bulletList\\\"|\\\"orderedList\\\"|\\\"listItem\\\"|\\\"blockquote\\\"|\\\"codeBlock\\\"|\\\"horizontalRule\\\"|\\\"hardBreak\\\"|\\\"image\\\"|\\\"sourceCitation\\\"\"},{\"code\":\"invalid_value\",\"values\":[\"paragraph\",\"heading\",\"text\",\"bulletList\",\"order