tensive and vulnerable to inaccuracies and fraud.\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"822425a5-8565-4599-a9ca-9f70c101ff79\"\n              }\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"6\"\n              }\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \" \"\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"dcd67a51-cc4b-403e-a08f-26053e82c5ed\"\n              }\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"bulletList\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"listItem\",\n              \"content\": [\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n                  \"content\": [\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"text\",\n                      \"text\": \"Reported fraudulent submissions included pictures of device screens, miniature reference displays and closed coolers.\"\n                    },\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                      \"attrs\": {\n                        \"sourceChunkId\": \"1de9ea14-99c9-4c41-986d-e14270819d32\"\n                      }\n                    }\n                  ]\n                }\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"listItem\",\n              \"content\": [\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n                  \"content\": [\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"text\",\n                      \"text\": \"At that scale, manual checking could not consistently verify submissions. The case study links inconsistent audit data to weakened merchandising execution and a lack of dependable insights for retail and merchandising decisions.\"\n                    },\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                      \"attrs\": {\n                        \"sourceChunkId\": \"1de9ea14-99c9-4c41-986d-e14270819d32\"\n                      }\n                    }\n                  ]\n                }\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"key\": \"section_3\",\n      \"content\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \"HumbleBeeAI implemented a computer-vision and AI solution within the provider’s distribution platform to automate checks on submitted field images. The documented capabilities target the specific forms of questionable evidence described in the case study.\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"b8333528-b67e-436a-b904-3e081491de0a\"\n              }\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"10ca1e12-c5e3-4ee0-bc88-ba250d6becc2\"\n              }\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"3ac9be85-e210-46cb-b7f0-c13d753c84fd\"\n              }\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"f132fea8-2460-4684-8fa8-6e30e48279af\"\n              }\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"heading\",\n          \"attrs\": {\n            \"level\": 3\n          },\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \"Multi-layered image checks\"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"bulletList\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"listItem\",\n              \"content\": [\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n                  \"content\": [\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"text\",\n                      \"text\": \"Device-screen detection: A classification model identifies images captured from a phone or tablet screen, helping flag photos of a screen submitted as field evidence.\"\n                    },\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                      \"attrs\": {\n                        \"sourceChunkId\": \"b8333528-b67e-436a-b904-3e081491de0a\"\n                      }\n                    },\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                      \"attrs\": {\n                        \"sourceChunkId\": \"10ca1e12-c5e3-4ee0-bc88-ba250d6becc2\"\n                      }\n                    }\n                  ]\n                }\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"listItem\",\n              \"content\": [\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n                  \"content\": [\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"text\",\n                      \"text\": \"Miniature-image analysis: An OCR-based algorithm analyzes text on product labels to identify the use of miniature or printed reference images.\"\n                    },\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                      \"attrs\": {\n                        \"sourceChunkId\": \"3ac9be85-e210-46cb-b7f0-c13d753c84fd\"\n                      }\n                    },\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                      \"attrs\": {\n                        \"sourceChunkId\": \"baff540c-b832-4986-8c34-c7aec9162d27\"\n                      }\n                    }\n                  ]\n                }\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"listItem\",\n              \"content\": [\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n                  \"content\": [\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"text\",\n                      \"text\": \"Closed-door verification: A model detects whether cooler doors are closed, a condition the case study says violates audit guidelines.\"\n                    },\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                      \"attrs\": {\n                        \"sourceChunkId\": \"f132fea8-2460-4684-8fa8-6e30e48279af\"\n                      }\n                    },\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                      \"attrs\": {\n                        \"sourceChunkId\": \"582392d8-5e5d-4cab-aff0-58a48883df4c\"\n                      }\n                    }\n                  ]\n                }\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \"The supplied examples illustrate the image types addressed by two of the checks.\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"10ca1e12-c5e3-4ee0-bc88-ba250d6becc2\"\n              }\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"baff540c-b832-4986-8c34-c7aec9162d27\"\n              }\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"image\",\n          \"attrs\": {\n            \"sourceChunkId\": \"10ca1e12-c5e3-4ee0-bc88-ba250d6becc2\",\n            \"alt\": \"Examples labeled device-screen images, including retail display images shown on a phone screen.\",\n            \"title\": \"Device-screen image examples\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"image\",\n          \"attrs\": {\n            \"sourceChunkId\": \"baff540c-b832-4986-8c34-c7aec9162d27\",\n            \"alt\": \"Examples labeled miniature images, showing small reference display images.\",\n            \"title\": \"Miniature-image examples\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \"For closed-door verification, the supplied examples show retail coolers with doors closed.\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"f132fea8-2460-4684-8fa8-6e30e48279af\"\n              }\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"582392d8-5e5d-4cab-aff0-58a48883df4c\"\n              }\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"image\",\n          \"attrs\": {\n            \"sourceChunkId\": \"582392d8-5e5d-4cab-aff0-58a48883df4c\",\n            \"alt\": \"Three examples of retail coolers with their doors closed.\",\n            \"title\": \"Closed-door image examples\"\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"key\": \"section_4\",\n      \"content\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \"The case study reports early detection performance and audit reliability gains, while also describing the operational and decision-support value of automated image review.\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"dcd67a51-cc4b-403e-a08f-26053e82c5ed\"\n              }\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"bulletList\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"listItem\",\n              \"content\": [\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n                  \"content\": [\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"text\",\n                      \"text\": \"Fraudulent submissions were detected with over 90% accuracy within the first week.\"\n                    },\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                      \"attrs\": {\n                        \"sourceChunkId\": \"dcd67a51-cc4b-403e-a08f-26053e82c5ed\"\n                      }\n                    }\n                  ]\n                }\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"listItem\",\n              \"content\": [\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n                  \"content\": [\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"text\",\n                      \"text\": \"The case study reports that overall audit reliability increased by more than 90%.\"\n                    },\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                      \"attrs\": {\n                        \"sourceChunkId\": \"dcd67a51-cc4b-403e-a08f-26053e82c5ed\"\n                      }\n                    }\n                  ]\n                }\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"listItem\",\n              \"content\": [\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n                  \"content\": [\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"text\",\n                      \"text\": \"The system processed image inputs from thousands of locations, automating a review task the source describes as infeasible to perform manually.\"\n                    },\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                      \"attrs\": {\n                        \"sourceChunkId\": \"dcd67a51-cc4b-403e-a08f-26053e82c5ed\"\n                      }\n                    }\n                  ]\n                }\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"listItem\",\n              \"content\": [\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n                  \"content\": [\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"text\",\n                      \"text\": \"The source says validated data enabled data-driven decisions and supported optimized merchandising strategies and stronger retail partnerships; it does not provide quantified business-impact measurements for those outcomes.\"\n                    },\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                      \"attrs\": {\n                        \"sourceChunkId\": \"dcd67a51-cc4b-403e-a08f-26053e82c5ed\"\n                      }\n                    }\n                  ]\n                }\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"key\": \"section_5\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n              \"content\": [\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"text\",\n                  \"text\": \"The case study describes the solution as implemented and integrated into the distribution platform. It does not provide model-evaluation definitions, test-set details, a measurement method for the reported audit reliability increase, or quantified cost savings, revenue impact or return on investment. No additional planned work, roadmap or known operational limitations are specified in the supplied material.\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                  \"attrs\": {\n                    \"sourceChunkId\": \"01025921-a8d2-447e-b52b-14b6cc48a58a\"\n                  }\n                },\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                  \"attrs\": {\n                    \"sourceChunkId\": \"dcd67a51-cc4b-403e-a08f-26053e82c5ed\"\n                  }\n                }\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n              \"content\": [\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"text\",\n                  \"text\": \"The source PDF refers to an “Open original HumbleBeeAI page,” but the page’s URL is not included in the supplied material, so a direct original-source link cannot be provided here.\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                  \"attrs\": {\n                    \"sourceChunkId\": \"479be1cc-1c01-43c3-9a25-a4da911df6e8\"\n                  }\n                }\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"key\": \"section_6\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n              \"content\": [\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"text\",\n                  \"text\": \"The documented implementation adds automated image-based fraud checks to a retail distribution platform, addressing a manual audit process that struggled with unreliable submissions at scale. The case study reports over 90% accuracy in detecting fraudulent submissions within the first week and an increase in overall audit reliability of more than 90%, while broader business outcomes remain unquantified in the supplied source.\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                  \"attrs\": {\n                    \"sourceChunkId\": \"b8333528-b67e-436a-b904-3e081491de0a\"\n                  }\n                },\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                  \"attrs\": {\n                    \"sourceChunkId\": \"dcd67a51-cc4b-403e-a08f-26053e82c5ed\"\n                  }\n                }\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"content\": [\n    {\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"text\": \"The platform supports sales and field teams, trade marketing, retail execution, warehousing, finance and analytics. To assess merchandising and in-store execution, its customers relied on field agents to submit audit reports and images from thousands of retail locations. The source describes manual review as costly, labor-intensive and vulnerable to inaccuracies and fraud.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n      \"attrs\": {\n        \"sourceChunkId\": \"822425a5-8565-4599-a9ca-9f70c101ff79\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n      \"attrs\": {\n        \"sourceChunkId\": \"6\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"text\": \" \"\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n      \"attrs\": {\n        \"sourceChunkId\": \"dcd67a51-cc4b-403e-a08f-26053e82c5ed\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\". Error: [{\"code\":\"invalid_value\",\"values\":[\"paragraph\",\"heading\",\"text\",\"bulletList\",\"orderedList\",\"listItem\",\"blockquote\",\"codeBlock\",\"horizontalRule\",\"hardBreak\",\"image\",\"sourceCitation\"],\"path\":[\"sections\",4,\"content\",2,\"type\"],\"message\":\"Invalid option: expected one of \\\"paragraph\\\"|\\\"heading\\\"|\\\"text\\\"|\\\"bulletList\\\"|\\\"orderedList\\\"|\\\"listItem\\\"|\\\"blockquote\\\"|\\\"codeBlock\\\"|\\\"horizontalRule\\\"|\\\"hardBreak\\\"|\\\"image\\\"|\\\"sourceCitation\\\"\"},{\"code\":\"invalid_value\",\"values\":[\"paragraph\",\"heading\",\"text\",\"bulletList\",\"orderedList\",\"listItem\",\"blockquote\",\"codeBlock\",\"horizontalRule\",\"hardBreak\",\"image\",\"sourceCitation\"],\"path\":[\"sections\",4,\"content\",3,\"type\"],\"message\":\"Invalid option: expected one of \\\"paragraph\\\"|\\\"heading\\\"|\\\"text\\\"|\\\"bulletList\\\"|\\\"orderedList\\\"|\\\"listItem\\\"|\\\"blockquote\\\"|\\\"codeBlock\\\"|\\\"horizontalRule\\\"|\\\"hardBreak\\\"|\\\"image\\\"|\\\"sourceCitation\\\"\"}]\n\nTroubleshooting URL: https://docs.langchain.com/oss/javascript/langchain/errors/OUTPUT_PARSING_FAILURE/\n\n    at JsonOutputKeyToolsParser._validateResult (/Users/johnpaul/projects/capstone_demo/node_modules/@langchain/core/src/output_parsers/openai_tools/json_output_tools_parsers.ts:312:13)\n    at process.processTicksAndRejections (node:internal/process/task_queues:104:5)\n    at async JsonOutputKeyToolsParser._callWithConfig (/Users/johnpaul/projects/capstone_demo/node_modules/@langchain/core/src/runnables/base.ts:385:16)\n    at async RunnableSequence.invoke (/Users/johnpaul/projects/capstone_demo/node_modules/@langchain/core/src/runnables/base.ts:1994:21)\n    at async OpenRouterService.runGeneration (/Users/johnpaul/projects/capstone_demo/app/services/open_router_service.ts:377:16)\n    at async OpenRouterService.generateOutlineWithEvidence (/Users/johnpaul/projects/capstone_demo/app/services/open_router_service.ts:179:21)\n    at async GenerationService.execute (/Users/johnpaul/projects/capstone_demo/app/services/documents/generation_service.ts:184:9)\n    at async GenerateDocument.execute (/Users/johnpaul/projects/capstone_demo/app/jobs/generate_document.ts:20:7)\n    at async _JobExecutionRuntime.execute (/Users/johnpaul/projects/capstone_demo/node_modules/@boringnode/queue/src/job_runtime.ts:93:7)\n    at async <anonymous> (/Users/johnpaul/projects/capstone_demo/node_modules/@boringnode/queue/src/drivers/sync_adapter.ts:204:13)","llmOutput":"{\n  \"sections\": [\n    {\n      \"key\": \"section_0\",\n      \"content\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \"AI-powered retail fraud detection helps a distribution SaaS provider validate field audits and support planogram compliance across thousands of retail locations.\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"479be1cc-1c01-43c3-9a25-a4da911df6e8\"\n              }\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"781ffd75-4b6e-41d1-bc10-df125bbf6480\"\n              }\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"key\": \"section_1\",\n      \"content\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \"A retail technology company partnered with HumbleBeeAI to add AI-powered fraud detection to its cloud SaaS distribution platform. The solution addresses unreliable field reports from distributors and manufacturers serving FMCG, beverage, pharmaceutical, automotive and related sectors. The case study describes the implementation as delivered and integrated into the platform; it says the provider serves over 600 customers.\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"781ffd75-4b6e-41d1-bc10-df125bbf6480\"\n              }\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"822425a5-8565-4599-a9ca-9f70c101ff79\"\n              }\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"01025921-a8d2-447e-b52b-14b6cc48a58a\"\n              }\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"key\": \"section_2\",\n      \"content\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \"The platform supports sales and field teams, trade marketing, retail execution, warehousing, finance and analytics. To assess merchandising and in-store execution, its customers relied on field agents to submit audit reports and images from thousands of retail locations. The source describes manual review as costly, labor-intensive and vulnerable to inaccuracies and fraud.\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"822425a5-8565-4599-a9ca-9f70c101ff79\"\n              }\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"6\"\n              }\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \" \"\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"dcd67a51-cc4b-403e-a08f-26053e82c5ed\"\n              }\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"bulletList\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"listItem\",\n              \"content\": [\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n                  \"content\": [\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"text\",\n                      \"text\": \"Reported fraudulent submissions included pictures of device screens, miniature reference displays and closed coolers.\"\n                    },\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                      \"attrs\": {\n                        \"sourceChunkId\": \"1de9ea14-99c9-4c41-986d-e14270819d32\"\n                      }\n                    }\n                  ]\n                }\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"listItem\",\n              \"content\": [\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n                  \"content\": [\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"text\",\n                      \"text\": \"At that scale, manual checking could not consistently verify submissions. The case study links inconsistent audit data to weakened merchandising execution and a lack of dependable insights for retail and merchandising decisions.\"\n                    },\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                      \"attrs\": {\n                        \"sourceChunkId\": \"1de9ea14-99c9-4c41-986d-e14270819d32\"\n                      }\n                    }\n                  ]\n                }\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"key\": \"section_3\",\n      \"content\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \"HumbleBeeAI implemented a computer-vision and AI solution within the provider’s distribution platform to automate checks on submitted field images. The documented capabilities target the specific forms of questionable evidence described in the case study.\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"b8333528-b67e-436a-b904-3e081491de0a\"\n              }\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"10ca1e12-c5e3-4ee0-bc88-ba250d6becc2\"\n              }\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"3ac9be85-e210-46cb-b7f0-c13d753c84fd\"\n              }\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"f132fea8-2460-4684-8fa8-6e30e48279af\"\n              }\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"heading\",\n          \"attrs\": {\n            \"level\": 3\n          },\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \"Multi-layered image checks\"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"bulletList\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"listItem\",\n              \"content\": [\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n                  \"content\": [\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"text\",\n                      \"text\": \"Device-screen detection: A classification model identifies images captured from a phone or tablet screen, helping flag photos of a screen submitted as field evidence.\"\n                    },\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                      \"attrs\": {\n                        \"sourceChunkId\": \"b8333528-b67e-436a-b904-3e081491de0a\"\n                      }\n                    },\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                      \"attrs\": {\n                        \"sourceChunkId\": \"10ca1e12-c5e3-4ee0-bc88-ba250d6becc2\"\n                      }\n                    }\n                  ]\n                }\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"listItem\",\n              \"content\": [\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n                  \"content\": [\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"text\",\n                      \"text\": \"Miniature-image analysis: An OCR-based algorithm analyzes text on product labels to identify the use of miniature or printed reference images.\"\n                    },\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                      \"attrs\": {\n                        \"sourceChunkId\": \"3ac9be85-e210-46cb-b7f0-c13d753c84fd\"\n                      }\n                    },\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                      \"attrs\": {\n                        \"sourceChunkId\": \"baff540c-b832-4986-8c34-c7aec9162d27\"\n                      }\n                    }\n                  ]\n                }\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"listItem\",\n              \"content\": [\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n                  \"content\": [\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"text\",\n                      \"text\": \"Closed-door verification: A model detects whether cooler doors are closed, a condition the case study says violates audit guidelines.\"\n                    },\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                      \"attrs\": {\n                        \"sourceChunkId\": \"f132fea8-2460-4684-8fa8-6e30e48279af\"\n                      }\n                    },\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                      \"attrs\": {\n                        \"sourceChunkId\": \"582392d8-5e5d-4cab-aff0-58a48883df4c\"\n                      }\n                    }\n                  ]\n                }\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \"The supplied examples illustrate the image types addressed by two of the checks.\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"10ca1e12-c5e3-4ee0-bc88-ba250d6becc2\"\n              }\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"baff540c-b832-4986-8c34-c7aec9162d27\"\n              }\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"image\",\n          \"attrs\": {\n            \"sourceChunkId\": \"10ca1e12-c5e3-4ee0-bc88-ba250d6becc2\",\n            \"alt\": \"Examples labeled device-screen images, including retail display images shown on a phone screen.\",\n            \"title\": \"Device-screen image examples\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"image\",\n          \"attrs\": {\n            \"sourceChunkId\": \"baff540c-b832-4986-8c34-c7aec9162d27\",\n            \"alt\": \"Examples labeled miniature images, showing small reference display images.\",\n            \"title\": \"Miniature-image examples\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \"For closed-door verification, the supplied examples show retail coolers with doors closed.\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"f132fea8-2460-4684-8fa8-6e30e48279af\"\n              }\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"582392d8-5e5d-4cab-aff0-58a48883df4c\"\n              }\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"image\",\n          \"attrs\": {\n            \"sourceChunkId\": \"582392d8-5e5d-4cab-aff0-58a48883df4c\",\n            \"alt\": \"Three examples of retail coolers with their doors closed.\",\n            \"title\": \"Closed-door image examples\"\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"key\": \"section_4\",\n      \"content\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \"The case study reports early detection performance and audit reliability gains, while also describing the operational and decision-support value of automated image review.\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"dcd67a51-cc4b-403e-a08f-26053e82c5ed\"\n              }\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"bulletList\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"listItem\",\n              \"content\": [\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n                  \"content\": [\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"text\",\n                      \"text\": \"Fraudulent submissions were detected with over 90% accuracy within the first week.\"\n                    },\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                      \"attrs\": {\n                        \"sourceChunkId\": \"dcd67a51-cc4b-403e-a08f-26053e82c5ed\"\n                      }\n                    }\n                  ]\n                }\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"listItem\",\n              \"content\": [\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n                  \"content\": [\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"text\",\n                      \"text\": \"The case study reports that overall audit reliability increased by more than 90%.\"\n                    },\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                      \"attrs\": {\n                        \"sourceChunkId\": \"dcd67a51-cc4b-403e-a08f-26053e82c5ed\"\n                      }\n                    }\n                  ]\n                }\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"listItem\",\n              \"content\": [\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n                  \"content\": [\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"text\",\n                      \"text\": \"The system processed image inputs from thousands of locations, automating a review task the source describes as infeasible to perform manually.\"\n                    },\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                      \"attrs\": {\n                        \"sourceChunkId\": \"dcd67a51-cc4b-403e-a08f-26053e82c5ed\"\n                      }\n                    }\n                  ]\n                }\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"listItem\",\n              \"content\": [\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n                  \"content\": [\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"text\",\n                      \"text\": \"The source says validated data enabled data-driven decisions and supported optimized merchandising strategies and stronger retail partnerships; it does not provide quantified business-impact measurements for those outcomes.\"\n                    },\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                      \"attrs\": {\n                        \"sourceChunkId\": \"dcd67a51-cc4b-403e-a08f-26053e82c5ed\"\n                      }\n                    }\n                  ]\n                }\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"key\": \"section_5\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n              \"content\": [\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"text\",\n                  \"text\": \"The case study describes the solution as implemented and integrated into the distribution platform. It does not provide model-evaluation definitions, test-set details, a measurement method for the reported audit reliability increase, or quantified cost savings, revenue impact or return on investment. No additional planned work, roadmap or known operational limitations are specified in the supplied material.\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                  \"attrs\": {\n                    \"sourceChunkId\": \"01025921-a8d2-447e-b52b-14b6cc48a58a\"\n                  }\n                },\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                  \"attrs\": {\n                    \"sourceChunkId\": \"dcd67a51-cc4b-403e-a08f-26053e82c5ed\"\n                  }\n                }\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n              \"content\": [\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"text\",\n                  \"text\": \"The source PDF refers to an “Open original HumbleBeeAI page,” but the page’s URL is not included in the supplied material, so a direct original-source link cannot be provided here.\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                  \"attrs\": {\n                    \"sourceChunkId\": \"479be1cc-1c01-43c3-9a25-a4da911df6e8\"\n                  }\n                }\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"key\": \"section_6\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n              \"content\": [\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"text\",\n                  \"text\": \"The documented implementation adds automated image-based fraud checks to a retail distribution platform, addressing a manual audit process that struggled with unreliable submissions at scale. The case study reports over 90% accuracy in detecting fraudulent submissions within the first week and an increase in overall audit reliability of more than 90%, while broader business outcomes remain unquantified in the supplied source.\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                  \"attrs\": {\n                    \"sourceChunkId\": \"b8333528-b67e-436a-b904-3e081491de0a\"\n                  }\n                },\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                  \"attrs\": {\n                    \"sourceChunkId\": \"dcd67a51-cc4b-403e-a08f-26053e82c5ed\"\n                  }\n                }\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"content\": [\n    {\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"text\": \"The platform supports sales and field teams, trade marketing, retail execution, warehousing, finance and analytics. To assess merchandising and in-store execution, its customers relied on field agents to submit audit reports and images from thousands of retail locations. The source describes manual review as costly, labor-intensive and vulnerable to inaccuracies and fraud.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n      \"attrs\": {\n        \"sourceChunkId\": \"822425a5-8565-4599-a9ca-9f70c101ff79\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n      \"attrs\": {\n        \"sourceChunkId\": \"6\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"text\": \" \"\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n      \"attrs\": {\n        \"sourceChunkId\": \"dcd67a51-cc4b-403e-a08f-26053e82c5ed\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}","sendToLLM":false,"lc_error_code":"OUTPUT_PARSING_FAILURE"},"taskId":"7bd0415a-c031-45a5-8b42-08eb4d170aa4","documentId":"9301d410-ac80-4094-a5d7-5f11c20d02fe","sourceRunIds":["4a58aeab-f8bc-4e14-981d-b2e9f54c3173"],"msg":"Document generation failed"}
