{"level":50,"time":1793899994264,"pid":18026,"hostname":"Johns-MacBook-Air.local","name":"CodeCanvas","err":{"type":"OutputParserException","message":"Failed to parse. Text: \"{\n  \"sections\": [\n    {\n      \"key\": \"section_0\",\n      \"content\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \"HumbleBeeAI built a Google Cloud Vertex AI training pipeline that helped a retail technology company cut custom model development time from two months to two weeks.\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"4c5ea7eb-5b69-4dc9-b953-10dc1dd77802\"\n              }\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"e1b8cf64-5e33-4857-870f-3d3dd7b9e010\"\n              }\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"key\": \"section_1\",\n      \"content\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \"A retail technology company specializing in brand compliance and merchandising needed to create and deploy product-detection models for customers with distinct product catalogs. Its specialist-led workflow made model delivery slow and difficult to scale. HumbleBeeAI implemented an Automated Training Pipeline on Google Cloud Vertex AI to simplify the process and enable non-technical teams to initiate and manage model training and deployment. The case study reports the solution as implemented and describes measured operational results.\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"69bd3625-336e-47da-be75-6388333349f8\"\n              }\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"e1b8cf64-5e33-4857-870f-3d3dd7b9e010\"\n              }\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"b5e32b3c-b3b8-41ae-831e-c5f127360062\"\n              }\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"key\": \"section_2\",\n      \"content\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \"The company served more than 50 clients, each with a unique product catalog, and needed custom product-detection models to monitor in-store product placement and brand integrity. Creating one model required one to two months of specialist machine-learning engineering work, leaving client success teams dependent on a small group of experts and creating delays and communication overhead.\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"69bd3625-336e-47da-be75-6388333349f8\"\n              }\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"d167cc2f-0174-43e0-a703-ec0f828fba78\"\n              }\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \"The source also describes enterprise-scale management and data-handling constraints: it says the largest enterprise client managed over 200 distinct product brands, while the existing infrastructure could not support the required continuous updates, version management, and automated deployment across geographic markets. Incoming datasets varied in format and quality, making preparation and validation for concurrent training projects difficult.\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"d167cc2f-0174-43e0-a703-ec0f828fba78\"\n              }\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"key\": \"section_3\",\n      \"content\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \"HumbleBeeAI implemented an automated workflow on Google Cloud Vertex AI, connecting guided model creation with dataset and model management. The case study describes these capabilities as delivered:\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"e1b8cf64-5e33-4857-870f-3d3dd7b9e010\"\n              }\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"heading\",\n          \"attrs\": {\n            \"level\": 3\n          },\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \"Guided model training for non-technical teams\"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"bulletList\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"listItem\",\n              \"content\": [\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n                  \"content\": [\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"text\",\n                      \"text\": \"A web-based guided interface let client success managers initiate custom training, configure parameters, and manage deployments without writing code, while providing visibility into training progress.\"\n                    },\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                      \"attrs\": {\n                        \"sourceChunkId\": \"e1b8cf64-5e33-4857-870f-3d3dd7b9e010\"\n                      }\n                    }\n                  ]\n                }\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"heading\",\n          \"attrs\": {\n            \"level\": 3\n          },\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \"Automated training and orchestration\"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"bulletList\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"listItem\",\n              \"content\": [\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n                  \"content\": [\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"text\",\n                      \"text\": \"The pipeline automated dataset preparation, hyperparameter tuning, model versioning, and quality assurance through managed training orchestration in Vertex AI, reducing manual workflow steps and standardizing outputs.\"\n                    },\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                      \"attrs\": {\n                        \"sourceChunkId\": \"e1b8cf64-5e33-4857-870f-3d3dd7b9e010\"\n                      }\n                    }\n                  ]\n                }\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"heading\",\n          \"attrs\": {\n            \"level\": 3\n          },\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \"Centralized datasets, models, and deployment\"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"bulletList\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"listItem\",\n              \"content\": [\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n                  \"content\": [\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"text\",\n                      \"text\": \"Integration with Google Cloud Storage provided centralized dataset and model management, automated dataset versioning, and a model registry to support collaboration and iteration. The case study also describes one-click deployment options.\"\n                    },\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                      \"attrs\": {\n                        \"sourceChunkId\": \"e1b8cf64-5e33-4857-870f-3d3dd7b9e010\"\n                      }\n                    }\n                  ]\n                }\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"heading\",\n          \"attrs\": {\n            \"level\": 3\n          },\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \"Pipeline workflow\"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \"The supplied diagram illustrates dataset management, model training, and Google Cloud Storage within the pipeline.\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"1feb4a51-7d79-4085-aa72-341946fed266\"\n              }\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"image\",\n          \"attrs\": {\n            \"sourceChunkId\": \"1feb4a51-7d79-4085-aa72-341946fed266\",\n            \"alt\": \"Diagram of the Vertex AI pipeline connecting dataset management, model training, and Google Cloud Storage.\"\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"key\": \"section_4\",\n      \"content\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \"The case study reports the following outcomes:\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"b5e32b3c-b3b8-41ae-831e-c5f127360062\"\n              }\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"bulletList\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"listItem\",\n              \"content\": [\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n                  \"content\": [\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"text\",\n                      \"text\": \"Model development time fell from 2 months to 2 weeks, reported as a 75% reduction.\"\n                    },\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                      \"attrs\": {\n                        \"sourceChunkId\": \"b5e32b3c-b3b8-41ae-831e-c5f127360062\"\n                      }\n                    }\n                  ]\n                }\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"listItem\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n              \"content\": [\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"text\",\n                  \"text\": \"Training-management overhead decreased by 90% for workflows serving the largest client, described in the results as having over 20 brands; the system managed over 20 models with automated updates.\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                  \"attrs\": {\n                    \"sourceChunkId\": \"b5e32b3c-b3b8-41ae-831e-c5f127360062\"\n                  }\n                }\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"listItem\",\n      \"content\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \"Client success teams could manage model creation independently, reducing the ML engineering bottleneck.\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"b5e32b3c-b3b8-41ae-831e-c5f127360062\"\n              }\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\". Error: [{\"code\":\"invalid_value\",\"values\":[\"section_0\",\"section_1\",\"section_2\",\"section_3\",\"section_4\",\"section_5\",\"section_6\"],\"path\":[\"sections\",5,\"key\"],\"message\":\"Invalid option: expected one of \\\"section_0\\\"|\\\"section_1\\\"|\\\"section_2\\\"|\\\"section_3\\\"|\\\"section_4\\\"|\\\"section_5\\\"|\\\"section_6\\\"\"}]\n\nTroubleshooting URL: https://docs.langchain.com/oss/javascript/langchain/errors/OUTPUT_PARSING_FAILURE/\n","stack":"Error: Failed to parse. Text: \"{\n  \"sections\": [\n    {\n      \"key\": \"section_0\",\n      \"content\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \"HumbleBeeAI built a Google Cloud Vertex AI training pipeline that helped a retail technology company cut custom model development time from two months to two weeks.\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"4c5ea7eb-5b69-4dc9-b953-10dc1dd77802\"\n              }\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"e1b8cf64-5e33-4857-870f-3d3dd7b9e010\"\n              }\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"key\": \"section_1\",\n      \"content\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \"A retail technology company specializing in brand compliance and merchandising needed to create and deploy product-detection models for customers with distinct product catalogs. Its specialist-led workflow made model delivery slow and difficult to scale. HumbleBeeAI implemented an Automated Training Pipeline on Google Cloud Vertex AI to simplify the process and enable non-technical teams to initiate and manage model training and deployment. The case study reports the solution as implemented and describes measured operational results.\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"69bd3625-336e-47da-be75-6388333349f8\"\n              }\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"e1b8cf64-5e33-4857-870f-3d3dd7b9e010\"\n              }\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"b5e32b3c-b3b8-41ae-831e-c5f127360062\"\n              }\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"key\": \"section_2\",\n      \"content\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \"The company served more than 50 clients, each with a unique product catalog, and needed custom product-detection models to monitor in-store product placement and brand integrity. Creating one model required one to two months of specialist machine-learning engineering work, leaving client success teams dependent on a small group of experts and creating delays and communication overhead.\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"69bd3625-336e-47da-be75-6388333349f8\"\n              }\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"d167cc2f-0174-43e0-a703-ec0f828fba78\"\n              }\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \"The source also describes enterprise-scale management and data-handling constraints: it says the largest enterprise client managed over 200 distinct product brands, while the existing infrastructure could not support the required continuous updates, version management, and automated deployment across geographic markets. Incoming datasets varied in format and quality, making preparation and validation for concurrent training projects difficult.\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"d167cc2f-0174-43e0-a703-ec0f828fba78\"\n              }\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"key\": \"section_3\",\n      \"content\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \"HumbleBeeAI implemented an automated workflow on Google Cloud Vertex AI, connecting guided model creation with dataset and model management. The case study describes these capabilities as delivered:\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"e1b8cf64-5e33-4857-870f-3d3dd7b9e010\"\n              }\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"heading\",\n          \"attrs\": {\n            \"level\": 3\n          },\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \"Guided model training for non-technical teams\"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"bulletList\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"listItem\",\n              \"content\": [\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n                  \"content\": [\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"text\",\n                      \"text\": \"A web-based guided interface let client success managers initiate custom training, configure parameters, and manage deployments without writing code, while providing visibility into training progress.\"\n                    },\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                      \"attrs\": {\n                        \"sourceChunkId\": \"e1b8cf64-5e33-4857-870f-3d3dd7b9e010\"\n                      }\n                    }\n                  ]\n                }\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"heading\",\n          \"attrs\": {\n            \"level\": 3\n          },\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \"Automated training and orchestration\"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"bulletList\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"listItem\",\n              \"content\": [\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n                  \"content\": [\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"text\",\n                      \"text\": \"The pipeline automated dataset preparation, hyperparameter tuning, model versioning, and quality assurance through managed training orchestration in Vertex AI, reducing manual workflow steps and standardizing outputs.\"\n                    },\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                      \"attrs\": {\n                        \"sourceChunkId\": \"e1b8cf64-5e33-4857-870f-3d3dd7b9e010\"\n                      }\n                    }\n                  ]\n                }\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"heading\",\n          \"attrs\": {\n            \"level\": 3\n          },\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \"Centralized datasets, models, and deployment\"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"bulletList\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"listItem\",\n              \"content\": [\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n                  \"content\": [\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"text\",\n                      \"text\": \"Integration with Google Cloud Storage provided centralized dataset and model management, automated dataset versioning, and a model registry to support collaboration and iteration. The case study also describes one-click deployment options.\"\n                    },\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                      \"attrs\": {\n                        \"sourceChunkId\": \"e1b8cf64-5e33-4857-870f-3d3dd7b9e010\"\n                      }\n                    }\n                  ]\n                }\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"heading\",\n          \"attrs\": {\n            \"level\": 3\n          },\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \"Pipeline workflow\"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \"The supplied diagram illustrates dataset management, model training, and Google Cloud Storage within the pipeline.\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"1feb4a51-7d79-4085-aa72-341946fed266\"\n              }\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"image\",\n          \"attrs\": {\n            \"sourceChunkId\": \"1feb4a51-7d79-4085-aa72-341946fed266\",\n            \"alt\": \"Diagram of the Vertex AI pipeline connecting dataset management, model training, and Google Cloud Storage.\"\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"key\": \"section_4\",\n      \"content\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \"The case study reports the following outcomes:\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"b5e32b3c-b3b8-41ae-831e-c5f127360062\"\n              }\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"bulletList\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"listItem\",\n              \"content\": [\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n                  \"content\": [\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"text\",\n                      \"text\": \"Model development time fell from 2 months to 2 weeks, reported as a 75% reduction.\"\n                    },\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                      \"attrs\": {\n                        \"sourceChunkId\": \"b5e32b3c-b3b8-41ae-831e-c5f127360062\"\n                      }\n                    }\n                  ]\n                }\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"listItem\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n              \"content\": [\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"text\",\n                  \"text\": \"Training-management overhead decreased by 90% for workflows serving the largest client, described in the results as having over 20 brands; the system managed over 20 models with automated updates.\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                  \"attrs\": {\n                    \"sourceChunkId\": \"b5e32b3c-b3b8-41ae-831e-c5f127360062\"\n                  }\n                }\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"listItem\",\n      \"content\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \"Client success teams could manage model creation independently, reducing the ML engineering bottleneck.\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"b5e32b3c-b3b8-41ae-831e-c5f127360062\"\n              }\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\". Error: [{\"code\":\"invalid_value\",\"values\":[\"section_0\",\"section_1\",\"section_2\",\"section_3\",\"section_4\",\"section_5\",\"section_6\"],\"path\":[\"sections\",5,\"key\"],\"message\":\"Invalid option: expected one of \\\"section_0\\\"|\\\"section_1\\\"|\\\"section_2\\\"|\\\"section_3\\\"|\\\"section_4\\\"|\\\"section_5\\\"|\\\"section_6\\\"\"}]\n\nTroubleshooting URL: https://docs.langchain.com/oss/javascript/langchain/errors/OUTPUT_PARSING_FAILURE/\n\n    at JsonOutputKeyToolsParser._validateResult (/Users/johnpaul/projects/capstone_demo/node_modules/@langchain/core/src/output_parsers/openai_tools/json_output_tools_parsers.ts:312:13)\n    at process.processTicksAndRejections (node:internal/process/task_queues:104:5)\n    at async JsonOutputKeyToolsParser._callWithConfig (/Users/johnpaul/projects/ca