aragraph\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \"HumbleBeeAI developed an on-device computer-vision approach to help cattle producers estimate carcass-quality bands before slaughter.\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"3a640fc8-ebc4-4c5b-8fa3-f63556ea9767\"\n              }\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"key\": \"section_1\",\n      \"content\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \"Beef Carcass Grading is intended for producers and field managers who need an earlier, more consistent signal about likely carcass quality. Traditional grading arrives after slaughter, when it can no longer guide timing or lot selection. The case study describes a mobile vision model that predicts premium, medium or poor quality bands from images of live cattle, returning confidence-scored results on-device.\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"3a640fc8-ebc4-4c5b-8fa3-f63556ea9767\"\n              }\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \"The source describes the model as packaged for mobile, offline use, but does not specify whether it is generally available, deployed in production, or still at a demonstration or pilot stage.\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"61d4ec55-7327-42d6-bdf9-43952c462012\"\n              }\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"key\": \"section_2\",\n      \"content\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \"Cattle operations face thin margins, volatile markets and uneven grading outcomes. In the described workflow, teams learn likely carcass quality only through post-slaughter grading, limiting their ability to adjust slaughter timing or sort lots beforehand. Visual assessment can also vary with personnel, lighting and field conditions; separate detection and classification tools can add operational friction, errors and latency.\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"08aedc14-dc31-4489-9fca-5fa3457043a6\"\n              }\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"f1bb31fe-be7c-4c0f-8ef2-5d881f33b962\"\n              }\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \"The project also had to account for limited labeled imagery, imbalanced grade classes, and variation across breed, camera angle and lighting. Ranch and feedlot environments may have limited connectivity and require low-latency, battery-conscious operation on mobile devices.\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"f1bb31fe-be7c-4c0f-8ef2-5d881f33b962\"\n              }\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"key\": \"section_3\",\n      \"content\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \"The case study describes a mobile workflow in which a field team captures a cattle image and receives a probability-weighted grade before the animal reaches slaughter. Its core capabilities connect a single model, domain-oriented training and offline mobile inference to the practical goal of supporting earlier decisions.\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"08aedc14-dc31-4489-9fca-5fa3457043a6\"\n              }\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"heading\",\n          \"attrs\": {\n            \"level\": 3\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"text\",\n          \"text\": \"Unified detection and grading\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"bulletList\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"listItem\",\n              \"content\": [\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n                  \"content\": [\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"text\",\n                      \"text\": \"One end-to-end deep-learning architecture performs cattle detection and three-class quality grading, avoiding a cascade between separate models and simplifying deployment and maintenance.\"\n                    },\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                      \"attrs\": {\n                        \"sourceChunkId\": \"90b45c2f-2fcc-4e1b-b0cb-fad6023febc5\"\n                      }\n                    }\n                  ]\n                }\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"heading\",\n          \"attrs\": {\n            \"level\": 3\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"text\",\n          \"text\": \"Training for field variation\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"bulletList\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"listItem\",\n              \"content\": [\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n                  \"content\": [\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"text\",\n                      \"text\": \"The model was fine-tuned on a custom-labeled dataset reflecting breed diversity, camera angles and variable lighting. Class weighting and targeted augmentations were used to address class imbalance and improve robustness.\"\n                    },\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                      \"attrs\": {\n                        \"sourceChunkId\": \"88c4077f-63fe-45f8-9369-918da12dc876\"\n                      }\n                    }\n                  ]\n                }\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"heading\",\n          \"attrs\": {\n            \"level\": 3\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"text\",\n          \"text\": \"Confidence-scored outputs\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"bulletList\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"listItem\",\n              \"content\": [\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n                  \"content\": [\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"text\",\n                      \"text\": \"Predictions include a confidence probability for premium, medium and poor bands, giving managers a basis for risk-aware timing and lot-selection decisions.\"\n                    },\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                      \"attrs\": {\n                        \"sourceChunkId\": \"305c02ad-cc6a-4f0f-a2a5-decf0b955e44\"\n                      }\n                    }\n                  ]\n                }\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"listItem\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n              \"content\": [\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"text\",\n                  \"text\": \"Visual overlays help field users verify detections.\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                  \"attrs\": {\n                    \"sourceChunkId\": \"305c02ad-cc6a-4f0f-a2a5-decf0b955e44\"\n                  }\n                }\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"heading\",\n      \"attrs\": {\n        \"level\": 3\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"text\": \"Mobile and offline inference\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"bulletList\",\n      \"content\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"listItem\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n              \"content\": [\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"text\",\n                  \"text\": \"The model is described as optimized for mobile phones and packaged for offline use, with instant predictions at the point of capture and no requirement for network access or specialized equipment.\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                  \"attrs\": {\n                    \"sourceChunkId\": \"61d4ec55-7327-42d6-bdf9-43952c462012\"\n                  }\n                }\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"image\",\n      \"attrs\": {\n        \"sourceChunkId\": \"5863819c-5f39-4cdd-b004-9a630d55a1f0\",\n        \"alt\": \"Illustration of cattle quality bands and a producer using a mobile device to review an animal assessment.\",\n        \"title\": \"Illustrative overview of mobile beef carcass grading\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}","sendToLLM":false,"lc_error_code":"OUTPUT_PARSING_FAILURE"},"taskId":"12f3da0c-c3a3-49e4-922c-617c835d10a4","documentId":"3ccf1cc1-742a-40e6-9409-ff1fc385d33b","sourceRunIds":["63ffb3c5-d459-4ec7-a01d-8ecb0aaef369"],"msg":"Document generation failed"}
