{"level":50,"time":1793935725578,"pid":18026,"hostname":"Johns-MacBook-Air.local","name":"CodeCanvas","err":{"type":"OutputParserException","message":"Failed to parse. Text: \"{\n  \"sections\": [\n    {\n      \"key\": \"section_0\",\n      \"content\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \"HStaff brings Hubstaff activity, Discord progress reports, and team analytics together to help distributed-team leaders monitor work and reporting in one place.\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"1a14a763-06bd-4751-939f-16dcbae22e1d\"\n              }\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"bb22044f-3165-4a84-84a9-ce79b66bf59e\"\n              }\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"key\": \"section_1\",\n      \"content\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \"HStaff is a workforce analytics platform for leaders managing distributed teams. Its purpose is to reduce the need to assemble a picture of team activity from separate time-tracking, messaging, and internal team records by presenting Hubstaff activity and Discord progress reports in a unified dashboard. The project brief identifies the platform as production ready; the supplied materials describe its capabilities but do not provide measured client business outcomes.\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"1a14a763-06bd-4751-939f-16dcbae22e1d\"\n              }\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"efe49f50-b2ac-4acb-aa35-5d285b6c1e34\"\n              }\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"key\": \"section_2\",\n      \"content\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \"Distributed-team managers may need to check several systems to understand tracked work, daily progress updates, and team relationships. The project materials describe fragmented data across Hubstaff, Discord, and internal databases, alongside manual collection and metric calculations, as barriers to a consolidated view.\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"97b23065-e904-420c-8ae0-352178bce73b\"\n              }\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"efe49f50-b2ac-4acb-aa35-5d285b6c1e34\"\n              }\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \"The challenge also included monitoring whether daily reports were submitted and accessing team information away from a desktop. The source describes the prior situation and constraints, but does not quantify the time spent on manual work or the effect of these issues on business performance.\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"97b23065-e904-420c-8ae0-352178bce73b\"\n              }\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"key\": \"section_3\",\n      \"content\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \"HStaff consolidates work activity and progress reporting into an analytics interface. The supplied project material describes the following capabilities:\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"1a14a763-06bd-4751-939f-16dcbae22e1d\"\n              }\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"37\"\n              }\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"bulletList\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"listItem\",\n              \"content\": [\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n                  \"content\": [\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"text\",\n                      \"text\": \"Unified team dashboard: summarizes team activity, tracked hours, deepwork percentages, recent activity, and progress-planning compliance, with navigation to detailed reports.\"\n                    },\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                      \"attrs\": {\n                        \"sourceChunkId\": \"8dce581-81af-454a-82ae-e5d5dd90efce\"\n                      }\n                    },\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                      \"attrs\": {\n                        \"sourceChunkId\": \"9610a7c5-0ce9-42ff-a574-dfebd4522a96\"\n                      }\n                    }\n                  ]\n                }\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"listItem\",\n              \"content\": [\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n                  \"content\": [\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"text\",\n                      \"text\": \"Hubstaff activity synchronization: collects tracked hours and project allocations, with hourly synchronization and historical data described for trend analysis.\"\n                    },\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                      \"attrs\": {\n                        \"sourceChunkId\": \"512e5df4-2fdc-4ba3-b65f-174e2af64b09\"\n                      }\n                    }\n                  ]\n                }\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"listItem\",\n              \"content\": [\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n                  \"content\": [\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"text\",\n                      \"text\": \"Discord progress reports: synchronizes daily reports, provides updates as new reports are submitted, and preserves Discord Markdown formatting.\"\n                    },\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                      \"attrs\": {\n                        \"sourceChunkId\": \"2988dde4-416d-418d-ac0d-fc79ea68fb36\"\n                      }\n                    }\n                  ]\n                }\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"listItem\",\n              \"content\": [\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n                  \"content\": [\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"text\",\n                      \"text\": \"Activity and performance views: presents individual and project-level metrics, date-range filters, and deepwork and tracked-hour details. The materials also describe daily breakdowns and project distribution in individual activity views.\"\n                    },\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                      \"attrs\": {\n                        \"sourceChunkId\": \"276911a9-f002-4b38-b12b-00afa0468eae\"\n                      }\n                    },\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                      \"attrs\": {\n                        \"sourceChunkId\": \"092a95c2-c7a5-447b-a16a-1089c2808eb6\"\n                      }\n                    }\n                  ]\n                }\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"listItem\",\n              \"content\": [\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n                  \"content\": [\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"text\",\n                      \"text\": \"Deepwork and reporting visibility: calculates focused work patterns and displays indicators intended to help leaders review report-submission compliance and identify where follow-up may be needed.\"\n                    },\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                      \"attrs\": {\n                        \"sourceChunkId\": \"13\"\n                      }\n                    },\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                      \"attrs\": {\n                        \"sourceChunkId\": \"37\"\n                      }\n                    }\n                  ]\n                }\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"listItem\",\n              \"content\": [\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n                  \"content\": [\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"text\",\n                      \"text\": \"Responsive access: the project materials describe layouts for desktop, tablet, and mobile devices.\"\n                    },\n                    {\n                      \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n                      \"attrs\": {\n                        \"sourceChunkId\": \"37\"\n                      }\n                    }\n                  ]\n                }\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"image\",\n          \"attrs\": {\n            \"sourceChunkId\": \"6660d8eb-01b6-4624-b34b-ea9ca4d0c944\",\n            \"alt\": \"HStaff dashboard showing a team activity and progress-planning view\",\n            \"title\": \"HStaff dashboard\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \"The supplied screenshot illustrates the dashboard's user-level view of deepwork and progress-planning information. It is a product interface example, not evidence of measured performance outcomes.\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"sourceCitation\",\n              \"attrs\": {\n                \"sourceChunkId\": \"6660d8eb-01b6-4624-b34b-ea9ca4d0c944\"\n              }\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"key\": \"section_4\",\n      \"content\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \"The available evidence supports a description of HStaff's reported functionality, not quantified business impact. No client outcome measurements, before-and-after comparisons, or adoption figures were provided.\"\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"bulletList\",\n      \"content\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"listItem\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n              \"content\": [\n                {\n                  \"type\": \"text\",\n                  \"text\": \"The source describes a consolidated view of Hubstaff activity, Discord reports, and team information as the intended response to fragmented data and manual reporting.\"\n                },\n                {